# Key Concepts — Access Reviews & Identity Governance

## Identity Governance

Identity Governance improves visibility into user access, lifecycle management, and secure identity controls within Microsoft Entra ID.

## Access Reviews

Access Reviews validate whether users still require access to applications, groups, and organisational resources.

## Guest Access Governance

Guest Access Governance improves visibility and control over external collaboration accounts and B2B identities.

## Lifecycle Governance

Lifecycle Governance manages user access throughout the identity lifecycle process.

## Zero Trust Governance

Zero Trust Governance assumes no identity or device should be trusted automatically.

## Governance Monitoring

Governance Monitoring improves visibility into identity governance activities, review workflows, and lifecycle governance controls.

## Outcome

The implementation improved identity governance awareness and strengthened lifecycle governance visibility within the DR Taxi environment.